`,e.jsxs(t.li,{children:["For named tasks the entry point writes ",e.jsx(t.code,{children:"START_<task>"}),", then ",e.jsx(t.code,{children:"FINISH_<task>"})," after the task function returns, then ",e.jsx(t.code,{children:"operative_gin_<task>.txt"}),". A finish marker is task-return evidence; it does not validate material fidelity, file completeness, or engine usability. In particular the operative config write occurs after the finish marker. ",e.jsx(t.a,{href:"https://github.com/princeton-vl/infinigen/blob/224598d4a2ff95b4fc928e72c222598b7122c698/src/infinigen/core/execute_tasks.py#L347-L378",children:"Source"}),"."]}),`
