`,e.jsx(t.li,{children:"Timing: retain rational timebases, original timestamps and event identities. A/V synchronization needs common-clock audio and visual markers at multiple points to separate offset from drift. ffprobe metadata and equal durations cannot establish audible synchronization."}),`
`,e.jsx(t.li,{children:"UI and localization: automated DOM accessibility checks leave manual, assistive-technology, native-widget and canvas assessments unresolved. Font shaping, glyph rasterization, message formatting and translation coverage are distinct layers."}),`
